      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "The pozil Node client is an available community implementation, not a Salesforce-supported SDK: its README supplies a Node installation command, while Salesforce’s repository categorizes the Node client under unsupported community samples. (medium confidence) (verified as of 2026-11-12)",
